    <dashboard name='Definition'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/HourlyLogisticsMetrics/Definition?rev=' id='240902' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/HourlyLogisticsMetrics' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_3' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_1' value='auto' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_4' value='top' />
          <format attr='text-align' id='dash-text_4' value='left' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1500' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1500' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3488' id='1' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='533'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='20'>Definition</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='95446' id='3' type-v2='text' w='49333' x='667' y='4021'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Purpose:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>We would like to have a closed view on Logistics Main KPIs by houlry. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Moreover, you can aggregate DT/ UTR/ Deliveries at your designated period.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Figures included only picked-up order and report dates based on [rider_accepted_at].</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Dt] </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The average delivery time calculated as the difference between [delivery_created_at] and [rider_near_drop_off], exlcuding preorders.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Utr]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'># orders divided by sum of actual rider hours.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Dispatching Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time between the first dispatch to the time the rider was notified. In case multiple rider were notified, the last event is taken.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Rider Reaction Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time between rider notification and rider acceptance. In case multiple riders accepted the order, the last event is taken.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Accepting Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time between the first dispatch to the time the rider accepted the order. In case multiple riders accepted the order, the last event is taken.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Driving to Res Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time between rider acceptance and arriving at the restaurant. This includes the time it took the rider to walk into the vendor.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[At Res Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time difference between rider arrival at vendor and the rider picking up the food.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Bag Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time the food has been in the bag.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'><![CDATA[IF rider_near_pickup <= original_scheduled_pickup_at]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>: rider_dropped_off_at - rider_picked_up_at</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'><![CDATA[IF rider_near_pickup > updated_scheduled_pickup_at AND at_vendor_time < 5 minutes]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>: rider_dropped_off_at - updated_scheduled_pickup_at </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>IF rider_near_pickup &gt; updated_scheduled_pickup_at AND at_vendor_time &gt; = 5 minutes</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>: rider_dropped_off_at - rider_picked_up_at.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Driving to CX Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time difference between rider arrival at customer and the pickup time.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[At CX Time]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time difference between rider arrival at customer time and the time the rider completed the delivery.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Vendor Delay]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The delayed actual pick up time compared to the original scheduled pickup time in seconds when this is attributable to the vendor.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>If rider spends &gt;= 5 minutes in the restaurant</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>: `rider_picked_up_at` -`original_scheduled_pickup_time`</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'><![CDATA[If rider spends < 5 minutes in the restaurant:`rider_picked_up_at`-`rider_near_restaurant_at`]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Rider Delay]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time difference between rider arrival at vendor and the original scheduled pickup time.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Delivery Delay]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The time difference between actual delivery time and promised delivery time.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Process : Shrink_1st -&gt; Shrink_2nd -&gt; Shrink_3rd -&gt; Close</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Shrink_1st_Rate]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Vendors delivery area shrink because of hurrier live delivery delay over the setting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[ Shrink_1st time / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Shrink_2nd_Rate]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Vendors delivery area shrink because of hurrier live delivery delay over the setting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[ Shrink_2nd time / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Shrink_3rd_Rate]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Vendors delivery area shrink because of hurrier live delivery delay over the setting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[ Shrink_3rd time / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Shrink 2nd_3rd]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Vendors delivery area shrink because of hurrier live delivery delay over the setting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[ (Shrink_2nd time + Shrink_3rd_time) / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Shrink_all_Rate]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[ (Shrink_1st time + Shrink_2nd time + Shrink_3rd_time) / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Close_Rate]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Vendors close because of hurrier live delivery delay over the setting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[Close time / All operating time.]</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='95446' id='4' type-v2='text' w='49333' x='50000' y='4021'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>How to utilize the report</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[1] </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>City Hourlt Logistics / Zone Hourly Logistics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>If you want to find specified details you can adjust the Kpis, Report Date, Hour and Shrink  at the up right.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[2] </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Hourly Aggregation</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>It can help you summarize dt/ utr/deliveries in the period you target.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Choose  a.Week/ City/ Zone/ Hour --&gt; b.Weekday</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>[3] </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Download</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>If you want to download the designed list with filter logic please click anywhere at the list and then click the button at the upper right </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>download.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{0209F271-42B4-433B-8D67-2EDBD709F40E}' />
    </dashboard>
